## Build Order & Verification Plan

I will build each step sequentially, confirming it works before moving on:

| Step | Module | Verification |
|------|--------|-------------|
| 1 | Scaffolding | `docker-compose up` starts all services, `/health` returns 200, DB tables created |
| 2 | Detect | Unit test: classify a known phishing email → score > 0.7; classify a legit email → score < 0.3 |
| 3 | Investigate | Unit test: investigate `example.com` → returns valid WHOIS/DNS data + LLM verdict |
| 4 | Unmask | Unit test: run simulation → returns 3-round transcript + analysis scores |
| 5 | Dashboard | Browser test: paste email → see all four panels populated with real data |

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Run from backend/
pytest tests/ -v
```

### End-to-End Verification
```bash
# Start everything
docker-compose up --build

# In another terminal, test the full pipeline
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/detect \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"subject": "Urgent: Verify your account", "body": "Click here to verify...", "sender": "security@amaz0n-support.com"}'

# Then use the returned email_id to call /investigate and /unmask
# Finally, open http://localhost:8501 for the dashboard
```

