## What We Are NOT Building Yet (Post-MVP Features)

These will be outlined in the README after the MVP is complete:

1. **Website/URL Classifier** — A second detection head for phishing websites
2. **Multi-Agent Debate System** — Prosecution/Defense/Judge agents that argue over the evidence
3. **Red-Team Adversarial Evaluator** — An agent that tries to craft emails that bypass detection
4. **LLM-driven Fake Sender** — Replace the scripted simulator with a dynamic LLM persona
5. **Real-time Email Ingestion** — IMAP/SMTP listener instead of manual paste
6. **Confidence Calibration** — Bayesian or ensemble methods for better score reliability
